            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাহু — bāhu — \"an arm (from shoulder to hand)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মীরা শিশুটিকে দুই বাহুতে তুলে নিল। mīrā shishuṭike dui bāhute tule nilô. Mira lifted the child up in both arms."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "হাত (taught) is the hand and, loosely, the whole arm; বাহু (bāhu) is the arm itself."
            }
          ]
        },
